        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwilanga kūfuma kūlī Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū īkī tūpīndiwe n'ilunde itaale gīko lya bakaanīji, hū kūhaya tūlekanagi na būlī mhayo gose ūyo gūkūtūdidohyaga, nī shibi īsho shitwitaligīngije. Twiyūmīlīje ū kūpeela ū mu wishiganhīlwa ūbo tūtūūlīlilwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū kūnū tūnkalalīlile Yesu, ū ng'winhi na nshikanya wa kūzunya kwise, ūyo akiyūmīlīja kūluha ha nsalaba, wīdalaha ī minala kūlwa būyegi ūbo walī atūūlīlilwe; ī haha igashije kū nkono gwa būlyo gwī Isumbī lya būtemi lya ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wideedeng'hanyagi ū ng'wenūyo, ūyo akiyūmīlīja mihayo ya būdalahwa būtaale gīko kūfuma kū banhū ba shibi, yaya ū kwinogolelwa nūūlū kūgwa ng'holò.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mulungu akahūgūlaga baana bakwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we a mininga ging'we gataalī kwidīka kūlwa nguno ya kwilwisha na shibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamo mukūgwībaga ū mhayo gwa būganikīji ūbo būkūmuwīlaga gītī mulī baana; gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūgoyela shigongo sha ng'wa Mulungu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bizagi na ng'hūmbū ja kwikala mu mhola nabo pye a banhū; na mushimīzīle mu wela, ūbo munhū atīko kūmona ū Mulungu ūlū atī nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilang'hanagi gete, atizilonga wa kūleba ū kūshika ū mu shigongo sha ng'wa Mulungu, na lītizilonga ijinji lya būsūngū mulī ose ose, līkandya kūfuluma; nose līsosohaje banhū bingī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atizilonga njingibo se ose nūūlū ng'hūnga, gītī Esau, ūyo akaponya būtaale bokwe bo kūbyalwa kwandya, kūlwa nguno ya shilīwa sh'ikanza līmò dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno mumanile gīkī, ū kū shikū ja kū būtongi akagema ū kūbiza na wingīji ū mu lubango, alīyo ūleng'wa nūūlū īkī akagūkooba na shisoji ū mhayo gwenūyo; atapandīkile gete ū ng'wanya gwa kūgalūka! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno a bing'we mutizile kū lūgūlū ūlo lūdūgije kūkuumiwa, gītī ūlo lwabakaga moto, mutizile kū giiti na būpi, nūūlū kū nyaga ntaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutizile kwilaka ly'ipembe lya kūdetemya, na mihayo ya magaka gīt'ūmo bakigwīla a bene, bandya kwikūmbīlīja gīkī batizongeja kūwīlwa mhayo gūngī! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno bakalemeelwa ū kwiyūmīlīja ū kūgūdegeleka ū mhayo ūyo gwahayiagwa; ī gīkī, “Nūūlū shiinū dūhū ūlū yūlūkuumya ū lūgūlū īkūpondwa mawe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwenūyo gūkabiza gwa magaka no, kūshisha nose nū Musa ūhaya, “Nogoha, nayūdetema!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we ng'wizile kū lūgūlū lo Sayuni, kū nzengo go ng'wa Mulungu mpanga, Yelusalemu ya ng'wigūlū; kū būhī na būhī bo bamalaika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wizile kwibita, na kanisa ya babyalwa ba kwandya, abo bandīkilwe ng'wigūlū; ng'wizile kūlī Mulungu Namuji wa bose, kū myoyo ya batūngīlīja abo bashikanyiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wizile kūlī Yesu Nsangīja wa Ng'wilagane ipya; kū mininga ayo gakidīka, ayo galī na būsombooji bowiza kūtinda ga ng'wa Abeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ilang'hanagi mutizūnemeela ūyo akūlūngalūngaga; nguno ūlū bakaduuma kūpūlūgūka abo bakaanemeela ūyo wabahūgūlaga mu sī, gūlī mhayo gwa kogohya no ū kū bise ūlū tūndalaha ūyo akūlūngalūngaga nise kūfuma ng'wigūlū; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūyo akītinginya ī sī a makanza gene. Gwike ī haha alīhaya mu kwisagīja gīkī, “Ū lūkangala ū lūngī natūtinginya sī dūhū, alīyo nakūlītinginya nī ligūlū!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū mhayo ūyū gīkī, “Ū lūkangala ū lūngī,” gūlī na makūlū ga kwīnjiwa ī shikolo īsho shiseemilwe, īsho shidūgije kūtinginyiwa; shisaage dūhū īsho shitūdūla kūtinginyiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū īkī tūlī banukūji ba būtemi būtī bo kūtinginyiwa, tūbizagi na kūlūmba; mhayo ūyo gūkūtūgunanha kūntūmamīla ū Mulungu chiza, mu kwifunya na logohano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Mulungu wise alī moto ūyo gūdūgije kūkenaagūla!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
